{"id":"n24555-6-7","stage":3,"title":"붙잡다 · 抓住(话头)","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24555-6-7-1","ko":"말꼬리만 붙잡지 말고 좀 내 얘기를 들으렴.","zh":"别光揪着我的话抠字眼，听我说完。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"말꼬리만","meaning":"话尾，话茬儿","explanation":"말꼬리：话尾，话茬儿；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"말꼬리","audio":"/audio/e8c36a8e8432e63090ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51688","senseId":"1","lemma":"말꼬리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말꼬리만","audio":"/audio/fa13916c3d2cbefac186.mp3"}},{"text":"붙잡지","meaning":"抓住(话头)，紧咬不放","explanation":"붙잡다：抓住(话头)，紧咬不放；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"붙잡다","audio":"/audio/648971b3f5c190ca20a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24555","senseId":"6","lemma":"붙잡다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"붙잡지","audio":"/audio/8247fded0e003dcc3c32.mp3"}},{"text":"말고","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말고","audio":"/audio/1473c8e39b00e08bbd22.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}},{"text":"얘기를","meaning":"谈话，说话","explanation":"얘기：谈话，说话；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"얘기","audio":"/audio/cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc7d2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74194","senseId":"1","lemma":"얘기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얘기를","audio":"/audio/d30eac53cdc9b914c064.mp3"}},{"text":"들으렴.","meaning":"听","explanation":"듣다：听；으렴：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"2","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들으렴","audio":"/audio/0534b8803d340efb607e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e8c36a8e8432e630","term":"말꼬리","zh":"话尾，话茬儿","audio":"/audio/e8c36a8e8432e63090ca.mp3","entryId":"51688","definition":"简短的话语或长话的最末尾。","pronunciation":["말ː꼬리"]},{"id":"648971b3f5c190ca","term":"붙잡다","zh":"抓住(话头)，紧咬不放","audio":"/audio/648971b3f5c190ca20a4.mp3","entryId":"24555","definition":"话语或其它状况继续不断。","pronunciation":["붇짭따"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"69296","definition":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc","term":"얘기","zh":"谈话，说话","audio":"/audio/cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc7d2b.mp3","entryId":"74194","definition":"向某人诉说与某事实、状态、现象、经验、想法等有关的话。","pronunciation":["얘ː기"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"聆听他人的话或声音等。","pronunciation":["듣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/293b848936f0ae3c4603.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24555-6-7-2","ko":"저도 할 말이 있다고요.","zh":"我也有话要说啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저도","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1"